  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Build an Ancestral Bio-Cultural Park   Teotihuacan</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The archaeological site of Teotihuacan is being destroyed by illegal constructions. The legislation is outdated and useless, the authorities do not have the capacity to protect it, and that the villagers lack sufficient knowledge to value and protect it.We propose the creation of a Pre-Hispanic Bio-cultural park that preserves and protects the archaeological remains, as well as the opportunity for the inhabitants of the area to carry out controlled ecotourism activities,  without damaging them</narrative>
  </description>
